Wen2025.pdf.md:106:## Two subtypes manifesting opposite gray matter morphological abnormalities are identi /uniFB01 ed
Wen2025.pdf.md:110:Regarding demographic and clinical variables, subtype 1 had a higher proportion of male patients than subtype 2 ( χ 2 = 16.161, p &lt; 0.001). Other variables, such as age of onset, illness duration, and symptom severity, did not differ signi /uniFB01 cantly between the subtypes ( p &gt; 0.05). Additionally, there were no signi /uniFB01 cant differences between the subtypes in TIV and IQR, indicating that these factors did not in /uniFB02 uence our results. These /uniFB01 ndings are summarized in Table S1.
